# Fetched fresh by CI/localnet setup on every run (see
# docs/mpl-core-integration-proof.md); never committed so drift from the
# live mainnet-beta deployment is always visible in CI output rather than
# silently stale in git history.
/vendor/mpl-core/*.so
/vendor/mpl-core/*.sha256
